    "iast": "taddevatāvibhavabhāvimahāmarīci-\ncakreśvarāyitanijasthitir eka eva |\ndevīsuto gaṇapatiḥ sphuradindukāntiḥ\nsamyak samucchalayatān mama saṃvidabdhim || 6 ||",
